"created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@leeksaltboy/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b747a48/uploads/origins/06ef9b63-531f-467b-8ff8-7d7849a6bed1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29b81728103a8541df090351dad7fc11", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b747a48/uploads/origins/06ef9b63-531f-467b-8ff8-7d7849a6bed1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29b81728103a8541df090351dad7fc11, https://si.imgix.net/8b747a48/uploads/origins/06ef9b63-531f-467b-8ff8-7d7849a6bed1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=395ac0c9172b704a6dd4bd2bd0258192 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b747a48/uploads/origins/06ef9b63-531f-467b-8ff8-7d7849a6bed1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f3393d8223111ba925013e9a796e2d3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "很高興認識你，我接觸的角色是因為我想看卡通風格（說話風格）的插畫，我一直在看插畫，初中一年級棒球俱樂部介紹了我最興奮的肚臍對戀肚臍女經理說我會讓人做愛，我希望你寫一個不用練習就能積極吸引肚臍的故事。只描繪觸摸肚臍和肚皮的手鈕扣請使用原來的女經理的衣服，只露出棒球俱樂部uni的肚皮部分。你可以看到各種孩子的各種表情和肚臍的形狀（debeso，垂直，洞肚臍）。至於訴求，我想用文字來表達我的肚臍，把塗鴉、肚臍穿孔、debeso等留在我的肚子上。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@leeksaltboy/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/451edfed/uploads/origins/e9703283-8bb8-4f88-a462-d0a43e91be31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1d3bfcd5d40706d56f38f6e6a92c74e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/451edfed/uploads/origins/e9703283-8bb8-4f88-a462-d0a43e91be31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1d3bfcd5d40706d56f38f6e6a92c74e, https://si.imgix.net/451edfed/uploads/origins/e9703283-8bb8-4f88-a462-d0a43e91be31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=871495e210b96c0592efa8ffdb1ac935 2x, https://si.imgix.net/451edfed/uploads/origins/e9703283-8bb8-4f88-a462-d0a43e91be31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200